# What this module needs that no single file owns.
#
# Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason, the same five fields a leaf declaration
# uses. The collector stamps the consumer column with this module's name, since the need
# belongs to the module as a whole rather than to anything inside it.
#
# Named dependencies-module rather than dependencies because this directory already holds the
# generated DEPENDENCIES, and on a case insensitive filesystem those two names are one file.
tmux | path | tmux | required | the multiplexer this entire module configures
fzf  | path | fzf  | required | every picker in this module is an fzf popup
